[%think 6390] [%out 6617] [%in 2] [%cacheread 0] [%cachewrite 2170] I'll play
…f5 to open lines, since my extra knight benefits most from an open position. -
**If exf5:** Nxd5 wins the pawn. The knight then hits the undefended b4 pawn
