blockade with Kf6. That keeps things steady and I stay a piece up. } 48. gxf5
f6 { [%emt 0:00:41] [%think 3048] [%out 3238] [%in 2] [%cacheread 0]
[%cachewrite 2194] The f5 pawn threatens f6+, which would fork my king on g7
